WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:02.169
We're gettin' through this.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.004
Says the gambler.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:09.843
I think it's really important
that we create a kind of library

00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:14.556
where people can understand
what it took to keep our country free.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.099
Crew: And action!

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.937
There is an era
that has to be recreated here.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.565
And there is no way
to have this level of authenticity

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:24.942
without all of our great artists.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:25.943
Shout out to Colleen.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.486
Four-time Oscar winner.
Stop playing with her.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:30.113
Austin Butler: Colleen Atwood
is the legend of legends.

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.074
I feel so fortunate that we had her.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.867
Anthony Boyle: Colleen's incredible.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:36.745
She really brings the characters
to the costumes.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.457
I started way before we started shooting,

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:42.835
manufacturing the leathers
the pilots wore,

00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:44.878
because no place in the world had them.

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:46.547
Colleen Atwood: And I needed,
for each character,

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.757
three or four versions of their costume.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:51.385
The target for today is Berlin.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:57.641
We did find a few B-17s in the world
that do occasionally fly.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.644
Gary Goetzman: But they weren't gonna
get us through production,

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.980
so we built two B-17s.

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:05.357
All right, boys, huddle up!

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:08.360
We ended up building full exteriors,

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.613
and then all the interior pieces.

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.323
Chris Seagers: That was,
pretty much, a year's work.

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:16.577
This looks great.
Every authentic detail in here.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:20.622
The combination of the construction
of the plane, with content walls,

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:24.793
gave the boys the real feeling
of fighters going by and shooting at them.

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:26.795
And I think it helped their reactions,

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:30.090
and them really feeling
what the terror might be like.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:32.092
Egan: Open fire!
Let 'em have it!

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:33.969
The volume is a gift.
It's phenomenal.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:35.888
The gimbal's moving,
and you're looking at that plane.

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:36.847
It zooms past.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.307
You know, you're in the plane.
You're fighting.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:43.312
This project,
it's an absolute dream come true.

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:48.400
Austin Butler: And you end up getting
in this flow where it becomes your life.

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:50.277
You just feel so blessed
to be a part of it.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.448
♪

